nda wagera )\n\n", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Guard App new:- \n\n-> SOS for guards communications \n    -> Guards can call other gate guard ( Based on Gate, Individual )\n    -> If SOS happens  ( All Guard will get notifide with ringing sound )\n    -> Also Admin will be notified\n    -> Guard coming or not.\n    -> Leave Option\n    -> \n\n-> Flat \n    -> SOS shows for Guards and Admin.\n\n-> Paisa collect krna app se ( chanda wagera )\n\n", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "labelPosition": null}, {"id": "C8-gjxn9Y6BtuiyYyDe2v", "type": "rectangle", "x": -15040.080047048592, "y": 474.1031158566215, "width": 599.1800186885448, "height": 417.36454020180196, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "bs0", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 889566098, "version": 146, "versionNonce": 819378382, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789458439783, "created": 1789458434756, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "TbUG8p7z4aBg8llS16hnD", "type": "rectangle", "x": -14989.547841457455, "y": 801.1057583996352, "width": 422.8363509331395, "height": 56.90147365172436, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "bs1", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1502236882, "version": 326, "versionNonce": 1531045070, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789458456852, "created": 1789458443354, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "sGJOQSKI8mItuup2QWt_F", "type": "rectangle", "x": -14541.991229313335, "y": 803.523535234413, "width": 75.22567703109416, "height": 52.454371661994514, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "ba